# DOCS WRITER role

- README: what it is, quick start via `make`, safety model (human gate).
- Operator runbook: install, config, kill switch, backup, restore.
- Doc for adding a new project (AI policy check first).
- Provide systemd units under `deploy/systemd/`.
- Do not invent runtime behavior—document only what `make test` / `make demo` prove.
